+  "p2": [{"title":"...","evidence":"file:line and concrete behavior","disposition":"..."}],
+  "summary": "concise causal verdict"
+}
+```
+
+Use empty arrays when none. `blocking_union_empty` must equal whether both P0 and P1 are empty.
